 → Pod 重启后进入 CrashLoopBackOff (事实 6)\n```\n\n### 根因结论\n\n已确认根因为 **容器内存限制 (96Mi) 远低于应用实际启动所需内存**。\n\n- 证据显示容器因 **Exit Code 137** 被频繁杀死（事实 1、事实 2），这是典型的 OOM Killer 特征。\n- Kubernetes 事件显示 Liveness Probe 失败（事实 3），结合 Tracing 数据显示正常请求可通但探针特定标记为 `liveness_fail`（事实 5），说明在内存极度紧张时，健康检查机制成为了触发重启的最后一道防线，或直接因资源竞争无法完成。\n- 虽然日志显示应用能响应 `/work` 请求（事实 4），但这发生在 Probe 失败之前或之间，说明应用代码本身无逻辑错误，而是受限于 96Mi 的资源约束。\n\n现有证据足以支撑“内存不足导致 OOM 及探针失败”的结论。\n\n---\n\n## 📊 性能统计\n\n```text\n├─ 总耗时: 1.8m\n├─ 问题定位: 18.7s\n├─ 并发证据采集: 76.0s\n│  └─ g1 aiops-case-10/workload-79d9f8fd88-bsn84: 76.0s (Evidence 64.2s, RCA 11.6s)\n└─ 汇总总结: 15.0s\n```\n\n📋 Runbook 参考\n\n- **g1 aiops-case-10/workload-79d9f8fd88-bsn84**: pod-crashloop-runtime\n", "answer_source": "workflow", "elapsed_seconds": 109.727, "metrics": {"run_id": "2a05f08b22d1412d", "mttr": {"value": "1.8m", "seconds": 109.73247599601746, "pass": true, "threshold": "< 10.0m"}, "evidence_completeness": {"value": "0%", "collected": 0, "planned": 0, "pass": false, "threshold": "> 90%"}, "root_cause_confidence": {"value": "42%", "pass": false, "threshold": ">= 80%"}, "runbook_coverage": {"matched": true, "runbook_id": "pod-crashloop-runtime", "pass": true, "score": 0.9333, "breakdown": [{"description": "Runbook 引用", "weight": 0.5, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.5}, {"description": "核心 Runbook 识别", "weight": 0.3, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.3}, {"description": "Runbook 结论关联", "weight": 0.2, "score": 0.6666666666666666, "weighted_score": 0.1333}]}, "confidence_breakdown": [{"name": "evidence_strength", "weight": 0.35, "score": 0.0, "weighted_score": 0.0, "description": "加权证据完整率", "detail": "加权完整率 0%"}, {"name": "causal_chain", "weight": 0.2, "score": 0.7, "weighted_score": 0.14, "description": "因果链完整性", "detail": "部分因果链"}, {"name": "tool_coverage", "weight": 0.1, "score": 0.3, "weighted_score": 0.03, "description": "关键探针覆盖率", "detail": "工具成功率 30%"}, {"name": "runbook_match", "weight": 0.15, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.15, "description": "Runbook 匹